{
  "$comment": [
    "TEST-ONLY rule overlay. Exercises the KSI validation engine end to end",
    "through real 2026 catalog rows without the shipped catalog claiming any",
    "of these rules. The shipped overlay (ccf/fedramp20x/rules_data/ksi_rules.json)",
    "has no verdict rules; nothing here is an assertion about what these indicators require."
  ],
  "rules": {
